do_1 = "At .github/workflows/paxeer-go-test.yml:185 pin only autobahn-integration to ubuntu-24.04 and add its docker-command exclusion to scripts/ci/runner-routing-check.sh:16, as permitted by decision 2864 at spec/layerx-merge/spec.kvx:10297; preserve its Make command, timeout, environment and unconditional steps, so fork requests also retain a hosted runner, and move its contract from RESTORED_JOBS at tests/ci/test_workflow_runs_on_routed.py:34 to HOSTED_JOBS at :37 with an exact runner and exclusion-reason assertion."
do_2 = "Extend container_runtime_use at scripts/ci/runner-routing-check.sh:120 to recognize the actual make -f chain.mk autobahn-integration-test consumer as requiring Docker before routing, including the existing supported explicit-runtime setup contract; cover the real workflow command and its Make to Go TestMain to Docker path at chain.mk:530, tests/integration/autobahn/autobahn_test.go:167 and :215, and chain.mk:426, without replacing that command with a direct Docker probe."
